  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\t\t\t<figure id=\"attachment_2737\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img class=\"wp-image-2737 size-large\" src=\"/media/archive/bed44a014039d022926596e76844555e4891af178f8a859cd52e300a76f8329a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"590\" loading=\"lazy\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-2737\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">©Doris Mee, Three On the Beach. Mixed Media.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>The Art Gallery of The Guild of Harwich Artists hosts a series of free Meet The Artist demonstrations throughout the summer on Saturdays, from 2 pm – 4 pm. Gallery artists share their tips and techniques in a variety of mediums including, pastel, watercolor, acrylic, oil, and mixed media; discuss painting en plein air; and talk materials and supplies. Read more about our <a href=\"/archive/source-a2dd2a8b0cc8efdccc38/\">Meet The Artist series</a>.</p>\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator\" />\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<footer class=\"entry-footer\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</footer>\n\n\t\n",
